### ==============================================================================
### FASE 1c: REST API CLIENT (PENGGUNA TANPA N+1, RESET PASSWORD, RIWAYAT HARGA)
### Format: VS Code REST Client
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Ambil Token CSRF Awal
# @name getCsrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/csrf
Content-Type: application/json

###
@initialCsrfToken = {{getCsrf.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 2. Login sebagai Akuntansi (Budi - full access)
# @name loginAccountant
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{initialCsrfToken}}

{
  "email": "budi@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
@csrfToken = {{loginAccountant.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 3. GET /api/users (Optimasi tanpa N+1: menyertakan companies & units per user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?role=PIC_UNIT&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. PUT /api/users/:id (Pembaruan Profil & Unit Sekaligus dalam 1 Transaksi Atomis)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "name": "Rina Kartika Updated",
  "email": "rina@ptcn.id",
  "role": "PIC_UNIT",
  "is_active": true,
  "unit_ids": [1, 2]
}

### 5. POST /api/users/:id/reset-password (Manual Password oleh Akuntansi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/2/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "new_password": "NewSecretPassword123!"
}

### 6. POST /api/users/:id/reset-password (Generate Otomatis 12 Karakter jika Kosong)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/2/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "new_password": ""
}

### 7. Kembalikan Password Rina ke Default agar tidak mengganggu sesi lain
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/2/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "new_password": "password123"
}

### 8. Ubah Harga Barang per Perusahaan (Mencatat ke item_price_history)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/items/1/prices
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "company_id": 1,
  "price": 2750000
}

### 9. GET /api/items/:id/price-history (Khusus Akuntansi - Riwayat Perubahan Harga)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/1/price-history
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Login sebagai PIC Unit (Rina) untuk Uji Coba RBAC
# @name loginPIC
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "rina@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
@picCsrfToken = {{loginPIC.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 11. Uji RBAC: PIC ditolak (403) saat mengakses GET /api/items/:id/price-history
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/1/price-history
Content-Type: application/json
